flowchart LR
    DEV[Developer]
    subgraph APP[Developer Environment]
        AGENT[AI Agent Application]
        EXT[Models / Tools / APIs / Retrieval / Agent Memory]
        SDK[Thin Debugger SDK<br/>OpenTelemetry]
        AGENT --> EXT
        AGENT --> SDK
    end

    subgraph PLATFORM[AI Agent Debugging Platform]
        INGEST[FastAPI Trace Ingestion]
        KAFKA[(Kafka)]
        WRITER[Trace Writer]
        CH[(ClickHouse Telemetry)]
        PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>Projects / Analysis / Knowledge)]
        INVEST[Debugger Investigator]
        GROUND[Evidence Grounding]
        UI[Debugging UI]

        INGEST --> KAFKA --> WRITER --> CH
        CH --> INVEST
        PG --> INVEST
        INVEST --> GROUND
        GROUND --> PG
        CH --> UI
        PG --> UI
    end

    SDK -->|Batched HTTPS/JSON| INGEST
    DEV -->|Optional authoritative docs| PG
    DEV -->|Investigates runs| UI
